{"agent":"wave-orchestrator","data":{"digest":"7b8adf64f5af7bb4","finding":1,"gate":"rubber_duck","location":"ddflow/infra/worktree/_create.py:isolate_venv","probe":"Refuted (evidence, not speculation): the finding requires VIRTUAL_ENV=/repo/.venv or /repo/.venv/bin on PATH. In this orchestration neither holds: echo $VIRTUAL_ENV is empty, and [REDACTED:path] = [REDACTED:path] (nix python3.14) -- [REDACTED:path] is NOT on PATH. The ACTUAL bug B4e7af0f14f vector is uv pip/uv run virtualenv DISCOVERY (no VIRTUAL_ENV, no local .venv -> walks up to the shared .venv), which this fix closes: /tmp repro shows a .venv-less nested worktree's  repoints the shared .pth, and a worktree-local .venv stops that walk (parent .pth untouched). An agent explicitly exporting VIRTUAL_ENV at the primary venv is outside ddflow's claim-time control.","severity":"HIGH","title":"ddflow/infra/worktree/_create.py:isolate_venv","verdict":"refuted"},"id":"e30c2edb0edf81496a6073a71","kind":"review.triaged","lamport":122409,"schema":1,"subject":"fix-B4e7af0f14f","ts":"2026-11-01T16:12:03.684365Z"}
